[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 27960.15, "timestamp": "07:46:00", "text": "集思广益。我应该把……放在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27963.59, "timestamp": "07:46:03", "text": "目录？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27973.75, "timestamp": "07:46:13", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27981.43, "timestamp": "07:46:21", "text": "呃，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27985.23, "timestamp": "07:46:25", "text": "你在这里。好的。等待。冷凝物表"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27987.03, "timestamp": "07:46:27", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27990.23, "timestamp": "07:46:30", "text": "这边。感觉太过了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27994.548, "timestamp": "07:46:34", "text": "要读的东西真多，对吧？所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 27997.99, "timestamp": "07:46:37", "text": "所以我觉得还缺两样东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28000.868, "timestamp": "07:46:40", "text": "当人们向上滚动页面时，我需要一个“呃”的提示。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28004.23, "timestamp": "07:46:44", "text": "到这里，到达这里，我想要一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28007.03, "timestamp": "07:46:47", "text": "按钮，用于自动滚动"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28011.19, "timestamp": "07:46:51", "text": "一路攀升至顶峰。这是其中之一。适用于移动设备"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28016.708, "timestamp": "07:46:56", "text": "用户，我们需要类似菜单系统的东西"}]